# Features whose requirements.md carries "Status: planned" or "Status: superseded" (scripts/check_sdd.py).
# One line per feature folder: "<feature>: <reason>". A status other than live with no line here, or a line with no
# reason, is a finding: a feature cannot leave the gate by relabelling itself. Reviewed with the pull request that adds
# a line. Every other feature is live.
